[ERROR]: ERR_SUBSTR_CANNOT_BE_KEY_COLUMN: Column "id" cannot be a SUBSTR column and key column at same time
LINE 12:1: ...ey (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY SUBSTR 1-2, v VARCHAR PIECE 1) GLOBAL...
                                         ^^^^^^^^^^
